---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CharacterCollection from '../components/CharacterCollection.astro';
import PageCharacter from '../components/PageCharacter.astro';
---

<Layout title="Baha'i Modules" activeNav="home">

<header class="bg-accent pt-36 pb-24 text-white">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-12 items-center">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-[3.5rem] font-black leading-[1.08] tracking-tight mb-6">Written materials for exploring the Faith together.</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed opacity-92 max-w-xl">Bite-sized written explorations. Built for small groups and real conversations.</p>
      <div class="mt-9 flex gap-3.5 flex-wrap">
        <a href="/modules" class="inline-block bg-white text-accent-deep font-semibold text-[0.9375rem] px-7 py-3 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-accent-pale hover:-translate-y-px transition">Browse modules</a>
        <a href="/about" class="inline-block bg-transparent text-white font-semibold text-[0.9375rem] px-7 py-3 rounded-md border-2 border-white/40 no-underline hover:border-white hover:bg-white/10 transition">About this project</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hidden md:block">
      <CharacterCollection />
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- Why these exist -->
<section class="py-20 md:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight mb-10">Texts to make it easier to teach</h2>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-8">
      <!-- Icon column + text -->
      <div class="hidden md:flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M17 3H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14l7-3 7 3V5a2 2 0 00-2-2z" stroke="#e04e1a" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="w-px flex-1 bg-gray-200 mt-3"></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.7] text-gray-700 max-w-2xl mb-5">Having written material to read together helps sustain conversation and keeps the focus on subjects worth discussing.</p>
        <p class="text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.7] text-gray-700 max-w-2xl">Without something to look at together, things drift. We talk about the weather, we talk about sports. Anything to keep from talking about subjects of real meaning.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hidden md:flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 01-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2z" stroke="#e04e1a" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="w-px flex-1 bg-gray-200 mt-3"></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.7] text-gray-700 max-w-2xl">Give a small group something to read together. Ask questions that cause people to think. Let the conversation go where it goes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hidden md:flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#e04e1a" stroke-width="1.75"/><path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2" stroke="#e04e1a" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="9.01" y2="9" stroke="#e04e1a" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="15.01" y2="9" stroke="#e04e1a" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-lg leading-snug max-w-2xl">In our experience, that combination has sparked three-hour discussions about suffering, the existence of God, what happens after death, and what it means to live a spiritual life in this century.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Phases journey -->
<section class="py-20 md:py-24 border-t border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4">Texts for every stage of interest</h2>
    <p class="text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.7] text-gray-700 max-w-2xl mb-12">Every module targets a specific stage of a seeker's relationship with the Faith. The subjects, the depth, and the assumptions about what a reader already knows shift accordingly.</p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-8 max-w-2xl">

      <div class="hidden md:flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-accent/40 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold shadow-sm shrink-0">1</div>
        <div class="w-px flex-1 bg-accent/20 mt-3"></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold mb-2">Discovery</h3>
        <p class="text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-600">For people encountering the Faith for the first time. The goal is a genuine "oh wow, this has a lot of interesting things to say" reaction.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hidden md:flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-accent/60 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold shadow-sm shrink-0">2</div>
        <div class="w-px flex-1 bg-accent/30 mt-3"></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold mb-2">Investigation</h3>
        <p class="text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-600">For people actively exploring. These modules go deeper into specific subjects and engage with harder questions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hidden md:flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-accent/80 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold shadow-sm shrink-0">3</div>
        <div class="w-px flex-1 bg-accent/40 mt-3"></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold mb-2">Consolidation</h3>
        <p class="text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-600">For people who identify as Baha'is and want to understand community life, institutions, and the many ways to serve.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hidden md:flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-accent text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold shadow-sm shrink-0">4</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold mb-2">Service</h3>
        <p class="text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Groups continue with Ruhi and other institute materials according to their areas of interest in service.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Open source -->
<section class="py-20 md:py-24 border-t border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
    <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-8 items-center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">Open source. Get involved.</h2>
        <p class="text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.7] text-gray-300 mb-4 max-w-xl">This project started in Boston. We are a small group of Baha'is who wanted better materials for sharing the Faith with seekers. We are still experimenting, still learning, still rewriting.</p>
        <p class="text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.7] text-gray-300 mb-6 max-w-xl">If you want to try these modules in your community, adapt them for your context, or help us write new ones, we would be grateful.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/naysawn/bahai-modules" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-gray-900 font-semibold text-sm px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:-translate-y-px transition" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/></svg>
          View on GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="hidden md:block opacity-20">
        <PageCharacter size="hero" inverted />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
